<view class="page onboarding">
  <view class="page-title">货小玲</view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">谁欠钱、哪单要交、哪个报价要跟，打开就知道。</view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">你主要做什么品类？</view>
    <view class="muted">这一步可以跳过，后面也能补。首版不会强制你填复杂资料。</view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{industries}}" bindchange="chooseIndustry">
      <view class="input industry-picker">
        {{selectedIndustry || '选择行业'}}
      </view>
    </picker>
  </view>

  <button class="primary-button" bindtap="start">开始记第一笔</button>
  <button class="secondary-button skip-button" bindtap="skip">先跳过</button>
</view>
